<title>USA: Mobile America Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Mobile America Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31:		    1997		1996</p>
<p> Total Revenues			 $15,249,620     $13,915,526</p>
<p> Provision for Income Taxes	     656,073	   485,000</p>
<p> Net Income				 1,566,692	 1,433,390</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>common stock and common</p>
<p>   stock equivalents		    6,236,316	 6,260,040</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			   .25		 .23</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 earnings rose despite weak revenues in January and February due to substantial rate increase in the personal injury protection lines of business, effective December 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Full name is Mobile America Corp.</p>
</text>
